{
  "name": "_shootingPracticeSetupMenu",
  "comment": "OpenSWOS's SHOOTING PRACTICE start screen, SWOS 2020's TEAM TRAINING layout (2026-11-02), shown by ShowFriendlyMenu in place of the friendly's own while g_shootingPracticeMode is on (src/shooting_practice_menu.c). ATTACK GOAL UP/DOWN (_practiceDirectionStrTable), CPU SKILL RANDOM (default)/BEGINNER..WORLD CLASS (_practiceCpuSkillStrTable: the strength band RANDOM TEAM draws the computer's side from), DEFENSE/MIDFIELD/ATTACK ON/OFF for the PLAYER's side and the CPU's (which lines each side keeps; ChangePracticeLine refuses to leave both sides with only keepers), PITCH TYPE (the friendly's own _friendlyPitchTypeTable / FriendlyPitchTypeProc; disabled by ShootingPracticeSetupInit when OPTIONS fixes the pitch), CHOOSE TEAM (TrainingChooseTeamsMenu: the friendly's ChooseTeamsMenu, coming back here), RANDOM TEAM (ShootingPracticeRandomTeams), EXIT. Runtime ordinals: 0 title, 1-4 the two top rows, 5-6 column heads, 7-15 the line rows (label, player, cpu), 16-17 pitch type, 18 CHOOSE TEAM, 19 RANDOM TEAM, 20 EXIT. No handler here may call CommonMenuExit (docs/MENUS.md section 12). Both targets: a classic packed menu, so the m68k build gets it from the baked src/menu_data.c.",
  "onInit": "ShootingPracticeSetupInit",
  "onReturn": "ShootingPracticeSetupInit",
